      "id": "0f0c32ab9b6e-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "What is the value of 0.8 X 0.8 X 0.8 + 0.7 X 0.7 X 0.7 + 2.52? 0.8 X 0.8 X 0.8 + 0.7 X 0.7 X 0.7 + 2.52 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the value of 0.8  X  0.8  X  0.8 + 0.7  X  0.7  X  0.7 + 2.52?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>0.8 X 0.8 X 0.8 + 0.7 X 0.7 X 0.7 + 2.52 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2.125 2.125",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2.125</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2.125</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "5.165 5.165",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">5.165</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5.165</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4.275 4.275",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">4.275</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4.275</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3.375 3.375",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">3.375</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3.375</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>0.8  X  0.8  X  0.8 + 0.7  X  0.7  X  0.7 + 2.52</p><p>= 0.8<sup>3</sup> + 0.7<sup>3</sup> + 3  X  0.8  X  0.7 (0.8 + 0.7)</p><p><b>We know that:</b> (a + b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + 3ab (a + b)</p><p>= (0.8 + 0.7)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 1.5<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 3.375</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
