    {
      "id": "0f0c32ab9b6e-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "The value of the expression (1.55 2 +0.55 2 +1.55 &#1093; 0.55) is equal to: &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; (1.55 2 +0.55 2 +1.55 &#1093; 0.55) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The value of the expression (1.55<sup>2</sup> +0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55 &#1093; 0.55) is equal to:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; (1.55<sup>2</sup> +0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55 &#1093; 0.55) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1.55 2 -0.55 2 1.55 2 -0.55 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1.55<sup>2</sup>-0.55<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1.55<sup>2</sup>-0.55<sup>2</sup></span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1.55 3 -0.55 3 1.55 3 -0.55 3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup></span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1.55 3 +0.55 3 1.55 3 0.55 3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1.55<sup>3</sup>+0.55<sup>3</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1.55<sup>3</sup> 0.55<sup>3</sup></span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1.55 2 +0.55 2 1.55 2 0.55 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1.55<sup>2</sup>+0.55<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1.55<sup>2</sup> 0.55<sup>2</sup></span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Formula of </p><p>a<sup>3</sup>-b<sup>3</sup>=(a-b)(a<sup>2</sup>+b<sup>2</sup> +ab)</p><p>let a=1.55 and b=0.55</p><p>so (1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup>)=(1.55-0.55)(1.55<sup>2</sup> + 0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55*0.55)</p><p>therefore</p><p>(1.55<sup>3</sup>-0.55<sup>3</sup>)=(1.55<sup>2</sup> + 0.55<sup>2</sup> +1.55*0.55)</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
