      "id": "0f0c32ab9b6e-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "Arrange the following ratios in ascending order. 3:4, 3:5, 2:11, 7:2 &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404; 3:4, 3:5, 2:11, 7:2",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Arrange the following ratios in ascending order. </p><p>3:4, 3:5, 2:11, 7:2 </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2357;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>3:4, 3:5, 2:11, 7:2 </p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "3:5 < 2:11 < 3:4 < 7:2 3:5 < 2:11 < 3:4 < 7:2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">3:5 &lt; 2:11 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3:5 &lt; 2:11 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "7:2 < 3:4 < 3:5 < 2:11 7:2 < 3:4 < 3:5 < 2:11",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">7:2 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 2:11</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7:2 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 2:11</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2:11 < 3:5 < 3:4 < 7:2 2:11 < 3:5 < 3:4 < 7:2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">2:11 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2:11 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3:4 < 3:5 < 2:11 < 7:2 3:4 < 3:5 < 2:11 < 7:2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">3:4 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 2:11 &lt; 7:2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3:4 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 2:11 &lt; 7:2</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>3:4 = 3/4 = 0.75 </p><p>3:5 = 3/5 = 0.6 </p><p>2:11 = 2/11 = 0.1818 </p><p>7:2 = 7/2 = 3.5</p><p>Ascending order: 0.1818 &lt; 0.6 &lt; 0.75 &lt; 3.5</p><p>So, 2:11 &lt; 3:5 &lt; 3:4 &lt; 7:2</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
