      "id": "0f0c32ab9b6e-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "What is the correct descending order of the following ratios? 17/30, 7/15, 27/50, 11/20 &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2309;&#2357;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;? 17/30, 7/15, 27/50, 11/20",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the correct descending order of the following ratios? </p><p>17/30, 7/15, 27/50, 11/20 </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2309;&#2357;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2368; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>17/30, 7/15, 27/50, 11/20 </p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "11/20 > 17/30 > 27/50 > 7/15 11/20 > 17/30 > 27/50 > 7/15",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">11/20 &gt; 17/30 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">11/20 > 17/30 > 27/50 > 7/15</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "17/30 > 11/20 > 27/50 > 7/15 17/30 > 11/20 > 27/50 > 7/15",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">17/30 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">17/30 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "17/30 > 27/50 > 11/20 > 7/15 17/30 > 27/50 > 11/20 > 7/15",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">17/30 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 7/15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">17/30 > 27/50 > 11/20 > 7/15</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "7/15 > 11/20 > 27/50 > 17/30 7/15 > 11/20 > 27/50 > 17/30",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">7/15 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 17/30</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7/15 > 11/20 > 27/50 > 17/30</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Convert to decimals: </p><p>17/30 = 0.56</p><p>7/15 = 0.46</p><p>27/50 = 0.54</p><p>11/20 = 0.55</p><p>Order: 0.56 &gt; 0.55 &gt; 0.54 &gt; 0.46</p><p>= 17/30 &gt; 11/20 &gt; 27/50 &gt; 7/15</p>",
