      "question": "Adi and Dia together have &#8377;1,440. If 3/10 of Adi's amount is equal to 3/5 of Dia's amount, how much amount does Dia have? &#2310;&#2342;&#2367; &#2324;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2325;&#2352; &#8377;1,440 &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2310;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; 3/10 &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; 3/5 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Adi and Dia together have &#8377;1,440. If 3/10 of Adi's amount is equal to 3/5 of Dia's amount, how much amount does Dia have?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2310;&#2342;&#2367; &#2324;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366;&#2325;&#2352; &#8377;1,440 &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2310;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; 3/10 &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2375; 3/5 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2342;&#2368;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "&#8377;480 &#8377;480",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;480</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;480</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "&#8377;540 &#8377;540",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;540</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;540</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "&#8377;464 &#8377;464",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;464</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;464</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "&#8377;512 &#8377;512",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">&#8377;512</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#8377;512</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Let Dia's amount = &#8377;n</p><p>Adi's amount = &#8377;(1440  -  n)</p><p>3/10 * (1440  -  n) = 3/5 * n</p><p>1440  -  n = 2n</p><p>3n = 1440</p><p>n = 480</p><p>Dia's amount = &#8377;480</p>",
