      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>2/3 &#8776; 0.6667</p><p>6/53 &#8776; 0.1132</p><p>79/90 &#8776; 0.8778</p><p>33/44 &#8776; 3/4 or 0.75</p><p>79/90 or 0.8778 is the largest</p>",
