    {
      "id": "0f0c32ab9b6e-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "A fraction 3/5 is decreased by 2/5. The resulting fraction is then increased by 20%. What is the percentage decrease/increase in the value of the original fraction? &#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; 3/5 &#2325;&#2379; 2/5 &#2360;&#2375; &#2328;&#2335;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2339;&#2366;&#2350;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; 20% &#2348;&#2338;&#2364;&#2366; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2361;&#2369;&#2312; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>A fraction 3/5 is decreased by 2/5. The resulting fraction is then increased by 20%. What is the percentage decrease/increase in the value of the original fraction?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; 3/5 &#2325;&#2379; 2/5 &#2360;&#2375; &#2328;&#2335;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2339;&#2366;&#2350;&#2368; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; 20% &#2348;&#2338;&#2364;&#2366; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2358;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350;&#2368;/&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2361;&#2369;&#2312; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Increase, 60% &#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;, 60%",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Increase, 60%</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;, 60%</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Decrease, 50% &#2325;&#2350;&#2368;, 50%",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Decrease, 50%</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2350;&#2368;, 50%</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Increase, 50% &#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;, 50%",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Increase, 50%</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;, 50%</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Decrease, 60% &#2325;&#2350;&#2368;, 60%",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Decrease, 60%</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2350;&#2368;, 60%</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>&#8226; Original fraction = 3/5 = 0.6.</p><p>&#8226; Decrease by 2/5 = 0.4 =&gt; New fraction = 0.6  -  0.4 = 0.2.</p><p>&#8226; Increase this new fraction by 20% =&gt; 0.2  X  1.2 = 0.24.</p><p>&#8226; Compare final value (0.24) with original value (0.6).</p><p>&#8226; The drop is 0.6  -  0.24 = 0.36, which is 0.36/0.6 = 60% decrease.</p>",
